                "message": "Document lem--late-modules and run vulpea-mcp-enable in :config\n\nsp-ai is loaded after init, so a top-level (vulpea-mcp-enable) called a\nfunction that was not built yet. The load-order doc now describes the\nlate-module variable, the keys that wait for it, and the problems found.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015tcMWj1Z6j2uCgMRYPBfDN",
