                "message": "Merge main into the late-modules docs; rename late-module API to sp-, load sp-ai at startup, add org-mcp\n\nsp-late-modules, sp-load-late-modules and sp-schedule-late-modules replace\nthe lem-- names. sp-ai leaves the late list so the vulpea-mcp and org-mcp\nservers are up with the daemon; mcp-server-lib is started in its :config.\nThe load-order doc and graphs follow the docs/architecture move and the\ncurrent late list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015tcMWj1Z6j2uCgMRYPBfDN",
